# CupidMQ — mapa derivado do código

**Tagline:** The brokerless P2P message queue where the master only plays matchmaker.

**Status:** experimental. **Pull matchmaker** + **data plane P2P** (TCP BATC). Modelo: **1 canal control** (master) + **entrega direta producer→consumer** com ACK.

**Repo:** standalone `cupidmq/` · branch **`main`** · `https://github.com/WilianZilv/cupidmq`

**Consumo externo** (sem clone): ver [README#use-in-your-project](README.md#use-in-your-project) · [RELEASING.md](RELEASING.md)

