## Regra agente — reiniciar após editar

**Sempre que alterar código de um componente do stack, verificar se esse processo está rodando e reiniciá-lo antes de encerrar a task.**

| Mexeu em… | Paths típicos | Processo | Como reiniciar |
|-----------|---------------|----------|----------------|
| **Master** | `master/src/**` | `cupidmq.exe` :9750–9752 | `cargo build --release` → matar → subir com `cupidmq.conf` |
| **Producer** | `master/src/producer/**`, `master/examples/cupidmq-producer.rs` | `cupidmq-producer.exe` | rebuild example → matar → subir de novo |
| **Consumer lib** | `python-client/cupidmq/**` | — | rebuild não precisa restart se só lib |
| **Consumer harness** | `python-client/harness/**` | `uv run python -m harness.consumer_cli` | matar python/uv → subir |
| **Dashboard** | `dashboard/src/**` | Vite `:5175` | matar porta → `npm run dev` |

**Restart parcial comum:** só consumers (testar `max-batch-size-count`) — matar python/uv consumer, **não** matar master/producers. Após restart master sozinho, producers reconectam com novos IDs.

**Windows — inspeção rápida:**

```powershell
Get-Process cupidmq, cupidmq-producer -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue
Invoke-RestMethod http://127.0.0.1:9752/metrics | Select-Object producers_connected, consumers_connected, producers_busy, delivery_failures_total
Stop-Process -Name cupidmq, cupidmq-producer -Force -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue
```

**Makefile:** `make run` | `make producer-run` | `make consumer-run` | `make test-rust` | `make test-python` | `make dashboard` | `make publish`.

