## Processos e portas (defaults)

| Listen (bind) | Connect (exemplo) | Handler | Protocolo |
|------|------|---------|-----------|
| **`0.0.0.0:9750`** | `127.0.0.1:9750` | `handle_control` | Control: producers `PRDY`/`HBRP`/`DELV`/`FAIL` + consumers `REG!`/`CRDY`; demux 1º magic |
| **`0.0.0.0:9752`** | `127.0.0.1:9752` | Axum | JSON `/metrics`, `/metrics/ticks`, `/metrics/history` |
| **`0.0.0.0:9760+`** | `127.0.0.1:9760+` (REG!) | consumer | Data: `BATC` |

Config: `cupidmq.conf` (`host`, `control_port`, `metrics_port`) → env `CUPIDMQ_HOST`, `CUPIDMQ_CONTROL_PORT`, `CUPIDMQ_METRICS_PORT` → CLI. Precedência: **CLI > env > file > default**.

