## Wire protocol (`src/protocol.rs`)

| Magic | Direção | Uso |
|-------|---------|-----|
| **`PRDY`** | Producer → master | Producer ready — ring local tem itens, pede match |
| **`HBRP`** | Producer → master | Heartbeat backlog (pending + ring + drops) |
| **`ASGN`** | Master → producer | Destino data `host:port`, max_items, tag |
| **`DELV`** | Producer → master | BATC entregue (msg_count, batch_bytes) |
| **`FAIL`** | Producer → master | Entrega falhou; itens requeued no producer |
| **`REG!`** | Consumer → master | Registra endpoint data TCP `host:port` |
| **`CRDY`** | Consumer → master | Consumer ready — pull batch (max_items + consumer_tag) |
| **`BATC`** | Producer → consumer | Batch wire frame |
| **`ERR!`** | Master → client (control) | Erro de protocolo no canal `:9750` |

Limites: item ≤ **32 MiB**; frame batch ≤ **64 MiB**. BATC usa `write_vectored`; flush extra se &lt; **64 KiB** (`FLUSH_BELOW_BYTES`).

