## Métricas HTTP

| Rota | Conteúdo |
|------|----------|
| **`GET /health`** | `ok` |
| **`GET /metrics`** | `MetricsSnapshot` — producers, consumers, rates, backlog |
| **`GET /metrics/ticks`** | Drain transfer ticks (assign/deliver/fail + `fail_message`) |
| **`GET /metrics/history?minutes=N`** | série amostrada (default interval 2s) |

Campos-chave: `transfers_total`, `batches_total`, `delivery_failures_total` (**BATC FAIL**), `producer_backlog_*`, `producers_ready/busy`, `consumers_waiting`, `consumer_inflight`.

Dashboard: **http://127.0.0.1:5175** — poll 2s; labels consumer `await BATC`, `BATC failed` (`consumerStateDisplay.ts`).

