## Roteiros validados (2026-06)

| Cenário | Setup | Observar |
|---------|-------|----------|
| **Stress 16p×20c TCP** | `stress-tcp.ps1` | ~300–400 batch/s, `delivery_failures_total=0` com pool keep-alive |
| **Batch-max sweep** | restart só consumers: 1 / 16 / 128 / 512 | capacity %, batches/s |
| **Consumer restart** | matar/subir consumers | busy stale ~15s → auto-clear; pipeline retoma |
| **Producer ring cap** | 1 producer lento | idle+backlog → promote Ready via HBRP |

